@startuml activity-expense-review
title SplitSmart — Activity: Expense Submit, Review, Approve/Reject

|Submitter (Swing)|
start
:Enter amount, date, description,
payer, participants, split method,
optional receipt;
:Send SubmitExpense(commandId);
|Server|
if (Same commandId already processed?) then (yes)
  :Return stored result;
  stop
endif
if (Active member, valid amount/currency/date,\ndistinct active-member participants?) then (no)
  :Return ValidationFailed;
  stop
endif
:Allocate shares (largest remainder,
alphabetical ties);
if (Identical-name tie crosses the cut?) then (yes)
  :Return AmbiguousAllocation (OD-01);
  stop
endif
:One transaction: expense PENDING_REVIEW (UNASSIGNED),
shares, notices, email outbox for signed-out members,
group version CAS, processed command, audit;
|Manager (Swing)|
:Designate one reviewer for this expense
(default reviewer may only prefill);
|Server|
if (Reviewer active member and != submitter\nand expense undecided?) then (no)
  :Return ReviewerIneligible;
  stop
endif
:Save ReviewerAssignment (version check);
|Reviewer (Swing)|
:Approve or reject (expectedVersion);
|Server|
if (Caller is the assigned reviewer\nand version matches?) then (no)
  :Return NotAssignedReviewer / StaleState;
  stop
endif
if (Decision) then (approve)
  :One transaction: acquire LedgerHead(group),
  ReviewRecord APPROVE, status APPROVED,
  ledger entries for non-payer nonzero shares,
  processed command, audit;
else (reject)
  :One transaction: ReviewRecord REJECT,
  status REJECTED, no ledger entries,
  processed command, audit;
endif
:Return terminal status;
stop
@enduml
